{#
| Variable                  | Type   | Description                                      |
|---------------------------|--------|--------------------------------------------------|
| component                 | object | merchant settings from twilight.json             |
| component.stat_number     | string | big stat, e.g. "152+"                            |
| component.stat_label      | string | stat label, e.g. "منتج في قصة"                   |
| component.stat_text       | string | cream-card paragraph                             |
| component.banner_title    | string | navy-card title                                  |
| component.banner_badge    | string | navy-card glass pill text                        |
| component.banner_image    | string | navy-card product photo (merchant upload)        |
| component.shop_text       | string | royal-card paragraph                             |
| component.shop_button_text| string | royal-card CTA label                             |
| component.shop_button_url | string | royal-card CTA link                              |
| component.shop_logo       | string | royal-card logo (merchant upload, optional)      |
| position                  | int    | sorting block                                    |

Figma: desktop 6036:926 (1440) — 3 cards in a row: cream stat · navy banner · royal shop.
       mobile  6036:21915 (428) — same cards stacked, REVERSED: royal · navy · cream.
Heterogeneous cards (not a collection). Glows are CSS gradients; photos are image fields.
#}
<section class="s-block qhcards" id="qhcards-{{ position }}">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="qhcards__row">

            {# Card A — cream stat card (RIGHT on desktop / BOTTOM on mobile) #}
            <article class="qhcard qhcard--stat">
                <div class="qhcard__stat">
                    {% if component.stat_number %}<span class="qhcard__stat-num">{{ component.stat_number }}</span>{% endif %}
                    {% if component.stat_label %}<span class="qhcard__stat-label">{{ component.stat_label }}</span>{% endif %}
                </div>
                {% if component.stat_text %}<p class="qhcard__stat-text">{{ component.stat_text }}</p>{% endif %}
            </article>

            {# Card B — navy product banner (MIDDLE) #}
            <article class="qhcard qhcard--banner">
                {% if component.banner_title %}<h2 class="qhcard__banner-title">{{ component.banner_title }}</h2>{% endif %}
                {% if component.banner_badge %}<span class="qhcard__banner-badge">{{ component.banner_badge }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if component.banner_image %}
                    <div class="qhcard__banner-media">
                        <img src="{{ component.banner_image }}" alt="{{ component.banner_title }}" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            </article>

            {# Card C — royal-blue shop CTA (LEFT on desktop / TOP on mobile) #}
            <article class="qhcard qhcard--shop">
                {% if component.shop_logo %}
                    <div class="qhcard__shop-logo">
                        <img src="{{ component.shop_logo }}" alt="قصة" loading="lazy"/>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="qhcard__shop-body">
                    {% if component.shop_text %}<p class="qhcard__shop-text">{{ component.shop_text }}</p>{% endif %}
                    {% if component.shop_button_text %}
                        <a href="{{ (component.shop_button_url and component.shop_button_url not in ['#', '/products']) ? component.shop_button_url : store.url ~ '/كل-المنتجات/c1390845573' }}" class="qhcard__shop-btn">
                            <i class="sicon-arrow-left"></i>
                            <span>{{ component.shop_button_text }}</span>
                            <i class="sicon-shopping-bag"></i>
                        </a>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </article>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
